block history name "Channel_2_DispMid" displacement-z position ([bLength/2],1.26,0.21)
block history name "Channel_3_DispTopQLeft" displacement-z position ([bLength/2-0.54],2.06,0.21)
block history name "Channel_4_DispTopQRight" displacement-z position ([bLength/2+0.54],2.06,0.21)
block history name "Channel_5_DispTable" displacement-z position ([bLength/2],0.0,0.21)
block history name "Channel_8_LeftJoistBelowSlab1" displacement-z position ([bLength/2-0.54],0.56,0.22)
block history name "Channel_9_LeftJoistAboveSlab1" displacement-z position ([bLength/2-0.54],0.66,0.22)
block history name "Channel_10_LeftJoistBelowSlab2" displacement-z position ([bLength/2-0.54],2.35,0.22)
block history name "Channel_11_LeftJoistBelowSlab2" displacement-z position ([bLength/2-0.54],2.45,0.22)

