block history name "Channel_13_AccSlab1" velocity-z position ([bLength/2],0.49,0.73) 
block history name "Channel_14_AccSlab2" velocity-z position ([bLength/2],2.28,0.73) 
block history name "Channel_15_AccBot" velocity-z position ([bLength/2],0.66,0.21) 
block history name "Channel_16_AccMid" velocity-z position ([bLength/2],1.26,0.21) 
block history name "Channel_17_AccTop" velocity-z position ([bLength/2],2.06,0.21) 
block history name "Channel_19_DispTopQRight" displacement-z position ([bLength/2],2.06,0.21)
block history name "Channel_20_TopBeam" displacement-z position ([bLength/2],2.68,0.21) 
model history name "time" dynamic time-total


